 // HA clinical-vignette questions: interpret the scenario, choose a safe first response.
 practiceQ.push(
  ["A 4-year-old child has diarrhoea, is lethargic, has sunken eyes and drinks poorly. What is the priority?","४ वर्षको बालकलाई झाडापखाला छ, सुस्त छ, आँखा गाडिएका छन् र राम्रोसँग पिउन सक्दैन। प्राथमिकता के हो?",["Urgent assessment and treatment for severe dehydration under the child-health protocol","Send home without assessment","Give an antidiarrhoeal drug routinely","Delay care until the next day"],0,"Lethargy, sunken eyes and poor drinking are danger signs. Assess urgently and manage severe dehydration according to the current national/WHO protocol; refer/escalate when indicated.","सुस्त हुनु, आँखा गाडिनु र पिउन नसक्नु खतरा संकेत हुन्। हालको राष्ट्रिय/WHO protocol अनुसार तुरुन्त मूल्याङ्कन र गम्भीर dehydration को उपचार गर्नुहोस्; आवश्यक परे referral/escalation गर्नुहोस्।","Community Health",["WHO: Diarrhoeal disease","https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/diarrhoeal-disease",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["A 52-year-old patient has crushing central chest pain, sweating and breathlessness for 30 minutes. What should the health worker do first?","५२ वर्षीय बिरामीलाई ३० मिनेटदेखि छातीको बीचमा कडा दुखाइ, पसिना र सास फेर्न गाह्रो छ। स्वास्थ्यकर्मीले पहिले के गर्नुपर्छ?",["Recognise possible acute coronary syndrome and arrange emergency transfer/assessment","Advise routine follow-up in one week","Ask the patient to walk briskly","Give food and wait for symptoms to settle"],0,"Persistent central chest pain with sweating and breathlessness may indicate acute coronary syndrome. Activate emergency care, assess ABCs and follow local protocol; do not delay transfer.","लगातार छाती दुखाइ, पसिना र सास फेर्न गाह्रो हुनु acute coronary syndrome को संकेत हुन सक्छ। आपत्कालीन सेवा सक्रिय गरी ABC मूल्याङ्कन र स्थानीय protocol पालना गर्नुहोस्; referral ढिला नगर्नुहोस्।","General Medicine",["NICE: Recent-onset chest pain","https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/cg95",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["A patient taking an ACE inhibitor develops swelling of the lips and tongue with difficulty breathing. What is the safest action?","ACE inhibitor खाइरहेको बिरामीको ओठ र जिब्रो सुन्निएर सास फेर्न गाह्रो भयो। सुरक्षित कदम कुन हो?",["Treat as a life-threatening airway emergency and arrange immediate emergency care","Reassure and review after 24 hours","Give the next ACE-inhibitor dose","Ask the patient to drink water and rest"],0,"Lip/tongue swelling with breathing difficulty may be angioedema with airway compromise. Stop further exposure, activate emergency response and manage airway/breathing according to protocol.","ओठ/जिब्रो सुन्निनु र सास फेर्न गाह्रो हुनु airway जोखिमसहितको angioedema हुन सक्छ। थप औषधि नदिनुहोस्, emergency response सक्रिय गरी protocol अनुसार airway र breathing सम्हाल्नुहोस्।","Pharmacology & Pharmacy",["NHS: Angioedema","https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/angioedema/",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["After a road traffic injury, a patient has a painful deformed lower leg and the foot is pale and cold. What is the priority?","सडक दुर्घटनापछि बिरामीको तल्लो खुट्टा दुखेको र बाङ्गिएको छ; पैताला फिक्का र चिसो छ। प्राथमिकता के हो?",["Urgent neurovascular assessment, immobilisation and emergency referral","Massage and straighten the limb forcefully","Encourage walking to test the injury","Apply a tight circumferential bandage and discharge"],0,"A pale, cold foot may indicate compromised distal circulation. Check and document distal pulses, sensation and movement, immobilise in the position found, and arrange urgent referral; do not force reduction.","फिक्का र चिसो पैताला distal circulation बिग्रिएको संकेत हुन सक्छ। नाडी, संवेदना र movement जाँचेर लेख्नुहोस्, भेटिएको अवस्थामै immobilise गरी तुरुन्त referral गर्नुहोस्; जबरजस्ती सीधा नपार्नुहोस्।","General Surgery",["Merck Manual: Fractures","https://www.merckmanuals.com/professional/injuries-poisoning/fractures/overview-of-fractures",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["A blood sample for potassium measurement is visibly haemolysed. What is the best laboratory action?","Potassium जाँचका लागि लिइएको रगतको नमुना स्पष्ट रूपमा haemolysed छ। प्रयोगशालाको उचित कदम कुन हो?",["Follow the laboratory rejection policy and request a properly collected repeat sample when indicated","Report the potassium result without qualification","Add water to the sample","Ignore the haemolysis"],0,"Haemolysis can release intracellular potassium and falsely increase the measured result. Follow specimen acceptance/rejection policy and request recollection when required.","Haemolysis हुँदा कोषिकाभित्रको potassium बाहिर निस्केर नतिजा झूटो रूपमा बढ्न सक्छ। नमुना स्वीकार/अस्वीकार गर्ने laboratory policy पालना गरी आवश्यक परे पुनः नमुना माग्नुहोस्।","Clinical Pathology",["Lab Tests Online: Potassium test","https://medlineplus.gov/lab-tests/potassium-blood-test/",false,"2026-11-25"]]
 );
 mockQ.push(
  ["At a community clinic, several people from one village develop vomiting and diarrhoea after a shared meal. What is the best initial public-health step?","समुदायको क्लिनिकमा एउटै गाउँका धेरै व्यक्तिलाई साझा खाना खाएपछि बान्ता र झाडापखाला भयो। जनस्वास्थ्यको प्रारम्भिक उपयुक्त कदम कुन हो?",["Notify the responsible public-health authority and begin a structured outbreak investigation","Assume it is unrelated and take no action","Close all clinics indefinitely","Give antibiotics to every exposed person without assessment"],0,"A cluster linked to a shared exposure suggests a possible foodborne outbreak. Notify the public-health authority promptly, establish a case definition, collect exposure/time data and coordinate appropriate sampling and control measures.","साझा exposure पछि धेरै बिरामी हुनु foodborne outbreak को शंका हो। जनस्वास्थ्य निकायलाई तुरुन्त जानकारी दिई case definition, exposure/time विवरण, आवश्यक नमुना र नियन्त्रणका काम समन्वय गर्नुहोस्।","Community Health",["WHO: Food safety","https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/food-safety",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["A 67-year-old suddenly develops facial droop and arm weakness. The family says the patient was last well 45 minutes ago. What information is especially important to record?","६७ वर्षीय व्यक्तिको अनुहार लत्रियो र हात कमजोर भयो। परिवारका अनुसार बिरामी ४५ मिनेटअघि अन्तिम पटक सामान्य थिए। कुन जानकारी टिप्नु विशेष महत्त्वपूर्ण छ?",["The exact time last known well and urgent stroke referral","The patient's favourite food","The date of the last dental visit only","Whether the patient can walk unaided before referral"],0,"Time last known well is critical in acute stroke assessment and treatment decisions. Activate emergency transfer immediately and do not delay for nonessential details.","Stroke को उपचार निर्णयमा बिरामी अन्तिम पटक सामान्य देखिएको समय अत्यन्त महत्त्वपूर्ण हुन्छ। तुरुन्त emergency referral गर्नुहोस् र अनावश्यक विवरणका लागि ढिलाइ नगर्नुहोस्।","General Medicine",["NICE: Stroke and transient ischaemic attack in over 16s","https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng128",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["A patient prescribed insulin reports that the insulin vial was frozen overnight. What is the safest advice?","Insulin प्रयोग गर्ने बिरामीले insulin vial रातभर जमेको बताउँछन्। सुरक्षित सल्लाह कुन हो?",["Do not use frozen insulin; obtain replacement and follow product storage instructions","Thaw it in hot water and use immediately","Shake vigorously and use as normal","Mix it with another vial to restore potency"],0,"Insulin that has been frozen should not be used because freezing can damage the product. Arrange replacement and follow the specific manufacturer's storage guidance.","जमेको insulin प्रयोग गर्नु हुँदैन, किनकि freezing ले औषधि बिगार्न सक्छ। नयाँ insulin को व्यवस्था गरी उत्पादकको storage निर्देशन पालना गर्नुहोस्।","Pharmacology & Pharmacy",["Eli Lilly: Insulin storage and handling","https://medical.lilly.com/us/products/answers/how-should-insulin-be-stored-114144",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["A patient with a suspected fracture has an open wound with visible bone and active bleeding. What is the safest immediate approach?","हड्डी भाँचिएको शंका भएको बिरामीको घाउ खुला छ, हड्डी देखिएको छ र रगत बगिरहेको छ। तुरुन्त सुरक्षित कदम कुन हो?",["Control bleeding with appropriate pressure around the wound, cover with a sterile dressing, immobilise and urgently refer","Push the exposed bone back inside","Clean deeply with household chemicals","Delay referral until swelling decreases"],0,"An open fracture is an emergency with infection and bleeding risks. Control bleeding without pushing on exposed bone, cover the wound with a sterile dressing, immobilise and arrange urgent hospital care.","Open fracture संक्रमण र रक्तस्रावको जोखिम भएको emergency हो। देखिएको हड्डीमा दबाब नदिई रक्तस्राव नियन्त्रण गर्नुहोस्, sterile dressing ले छोप्नुहोस्, immobilise गरी तुरुन्त अस्पताल पठाउनुहोस्।","General Surgery",["NHS: Broken leg","https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/broken-leg/",false,"2026-11-25"]],
  ["A patient has fever and suspected bacterial infection. Two sets of blood cultures are ordered before antibiotics. What is the key reason to collect them first when this does not delay urgent treatment?","ज्वरो र bacterial infection को शंका भएको बिरामीका लागि antibiotics अघि दुई सेट blood culture मागिएको छ। आपत्कालीन उपचार ढिला नहुने अवस्थामा पहिले नमुना लिनुको मुख्य कारण के हो?",["To improve pathogen detection before antibiotics reduce culture yield","To measure blood glucose","To determine blood group only","To replace the need for clinical assessment"],0,"Blood cultures collected before antimicrobial therapy, when feasible without delaying urgent treatment, improve the chance of identifying the causative organism and guiding targeted therapy.","आपत्कालीन उपचार ढिला नगरी सम्भव भए antimicrobial सुरु गर्नुअघि blood culture लिँदा कारणी जीवाणु पहिचान र लक्षित उपचारमा मद्दत पुग्छ।","Clinical Pathology",["CDC: Blood culture collection","https://www.cdc.gov/infection-control/hcp/blood-culture/index.html",false,"2026-11-25"]]
 );
